{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TASU Bowl</strong> is a deck-building game that combines roguelike elements with bowling.<br>Scoring over 300 points isn\u2019t just a dream\u2014it\u2019s totally possible!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How many games can you survive?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each game sets a new target score.<br>To beat it, you\u2019ll upgrade and modify your balls, pins, frames, and items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/1_scoreboard.png?t=1745199473\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the game ends, you can spend your hard-earned cash at the shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/2_shop.png?t=1745199473\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Balls with wild effects</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The balls you throw are packed with special powers!<br>From high-scoring balls, giant balls, and ones with strange movement,<br>to balls that place gates or power up pins\u2014customize your deck to match your playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/3_snake.gif?t=1745199473\" />\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/3_number.gif?t=1745199473\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/3_ball.png?t=1745199473\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lively pins with crazy abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pins can have their own effects too!<br>Some, like the \u201cZombie\u201d pin, come back to life even after being knocked down!<br>You can also increase or decrease the number of pins\u2014<br>go for a bigger knockdown or make it easier to hit strikes and spares!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/4_pin_ingame.png?t=1745199473\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/5_pin.png?t=1745199473\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Special frames with added twists</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even the <strong>frames</strong> where your scores are written can have unique effects!<br>We\u2019ve shortened the game to 4 frames instead of the usual 10 for casual play,<br>but you can buy more frames at the shop for a longer experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/6_frameEffect.png?t=1745199473\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Choose items to match your strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some items provide passive effects just by holding them,<br>while others can be activated at the perfect moment!<br>Get bonus points for strikes, or boost your next throw with powerful consumables!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Image: In-game screen showing item icons and hover effects</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3607840?t=1745199473","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3607840?t=1745199473","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/34a2e658f05051623b0bc6af913ccdd63ef245e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745199473","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/34a2e658f05051623b0bc6af91