ities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pins can have their own effects too!<br>Some, like the \u201cZombie\u201d pin, come back to life even after being knocked down!<br>You can also increase or decrease the number of pins\u2014<br>go for a bigger knockdown or make it easier to hit strikes and spares!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/4_pin_ingame.png?t=1745199473\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/5_pin.png?t=1745199473\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Special frames with added twists</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even the <strong>frames</strong> where your scores are written can have unique effects!<br>We\u2019ve shortened the game to 4 frames instead of the usual 10 for casual play,<br>but you can buy more frames at the shop for a longer experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/extras/6_frameEffect.png?t=1745199473\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Choose items to match your strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some items provide passive effects just by holding them,<br>while others can be activated at the perfect moment!<br>Get bonus points for strikes, or boost your next throw with powerful consumables!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Image: In-game screen showing item icons and hover effects</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["KAYAC Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607840/28e3a90402afacbd9bf652632043085e6c7fcfde/header.jpg?t=1745199473","is_f